{"source":"user-event","type":"click","text":"HOME\n        PROJECTS\n        TIMELINE\n      \n      Content panels float anchored inside the 3D world; camera flies between them\n    \n    \n      A — Camera journey through one world\n      Routes are camera positions in a single 3D space. Navigation literally flies you to the next place; content panels live \"in\" the world. Maximum immersion, but content readability and mobile behavior are hardest to get right, and long text fights the metaphor.","choice":"camera-journey","id":null,"timestamp":1783081418343}
{"source":"user-event","type":"click","text":"INTRO\n        WORK\n        STORY\n        CONTACT\n        \n        scroll = camera scrub\n      \n      One long scroll story; deeper pages are simple \"rooms\"\n    \n    \n      C — Scroll-film + rooms\n      The homepage becomes one long scroll-driven cinematic — scrolling scrubs the camera through your story (intro → work → journey → contact). Detail pages (Wordle, project pages) are quieter rooms. Great narrative control, but the wow concentrates on the homepage; inner pages feel more ordinary.","choice":"scroll-film","id":null,"timestamp":1783081419068}
